            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Daftar ini berisi film seperti <code>\"Vertigo\"</code> dan tanggal rilis seperti <code>1958</code>, tetapi tidak jelas tanggal mana yang terkait dengan film mana.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"movies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Vertigo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Parasite&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1958\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2019\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"Vertigo\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>List ini harus berisi film <code>\"Vertigo\"</code> dan <code>\"Parasite\"</code>, lalu tanggal rilisnya, <code>1958</code> dan <code>2019</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"movies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Vertigo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Parasite&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1958\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2019\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"Vertigo\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Intro 2",
            "id": 88424,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita dapat mengelompokkan bagian data yang berkaitan dengan <strong>tuple</strong>, seperti pada <code>movie_tuples</code> di sini, yang mengelompokkan nama film dan tanggal rilis bersama-sama.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"movies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Vertigo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Parasite&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1958\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2019\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"movie_tuples = [(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Vertigo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1958\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"), (\" /><text value=\"&quot;Parasite&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2019\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")]\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"80\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>(\"Vertigo\", 1958)</code>, diikuti oleh <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tuple mengelompokkan data terkait. Gunakan tuple untuk memasangkan <code>\"Vertigo\"</code> dengan <code>1958</code>, mengikuti contoh film kedua.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"movies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Vertigo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Parasite&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1958\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2019\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"movie_tuples = [(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Vertigo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1958\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"), (\" /><text value=\"&quot;Parasite&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2019\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")]\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[&quot;Vertigo&quot;, 1958]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>(\"Vertigo\", 1958)</code>, diikuti oleh <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Tuples",
            "id": 88353,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><strong>Tuple</strong> membantu kita mengelompokkan berbagai bagian data yang saling berkaitan, seperti pada tuple <code>vertigo_data</code> di sini.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"vertigo_data = (\" /><text value=\"&quot;Vertigo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1958\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(vertigo_data)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"('Vertigo', 1958)\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>vertigo_data</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><strong>Tuple</strong> mengelompokkan data yang saling terkait. Simpan <code>\"Vertigo\"</code> dan <code>1958</code> dalam <code>vertigo_data</code> agar kode menampilkan <code>('Vertigo', 1958)</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"vertigo_data\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Vertigo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"1958\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"vertigo_data\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[&quot;Vertigo&quot;, 1958]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"('Vertigo', 1958)\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>(\"Vertigo\", 1958)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Parentheses",
            "id": 88354,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita membuat tuple dengan cara yang mirip seperti list, tetapi kita menggunakan tanda kurung <code>()</code>, bukan tanda kurung siku di sekitar nilainya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"vertigo_data = (\" /><text value=\"&quot;Vertigo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1958\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(vertigo_data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\",\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"('Vertigo', 1958)\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>(</code>, diikuti oleh <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita membuat tuple dengan cara yang mirip seperti list, tetapi kita menggunakan tanda kurung <code>()</code>, bukan tanda kurung siku di sekitar nilainya.</p><p>Buat kode menampilkan <code>('Vertigo', 1958)</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"vertigo_data = (\" /><text value=\"&quot;Vertigo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1958\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(vertigo_data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"('Vertigo', 1958)\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>(</code>, diikuti oleh <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Commas",
            "id": 88355,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Seperti pada elemen list, kita menggunakan koma <code>,</code> untuk memisahkan nilai dalam tuple.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"vertigo_data = (\" /><text value=\"&quot;Vertigo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1958\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(vertigo_data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"('Vertigo', 1958)\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Only one value",
            "id": 88356,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sebagai kasus khusus, tuple yang hanya memiliki satu nilai tetap diakhiri dengan koma.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user_data = (\" /><text value=\"&quot;joe_17&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(user_data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"('joe_17',)\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"joe_17\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tuple dengan satu nilai tetap memerlukan koma setelahnya. Simpan <code>\"joe_17\"</code> dalam <code>user_data</code> agar kode menampilkan <code>('joe_17',)</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user_data = (\" /><text value=\"&quot;joe_17&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(user_data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"joe_17\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Joe Reed&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"('joe_17',)\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"joe_17\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "As many as we want",
            "id": 88357,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tuple dapat memiliki sebanyak apa pun nilai yang kita inginkan, seperti nama film, tanggal rilis, dan sutradara seperti <code>\"A. Hitchcock\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"vertigo_data = (\" /><text value=\"&quot;Vertigo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1958\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;A. Hitchcock&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(vertigo_data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"47\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"('Vertigo', 1958, 'A. Hitchcock')\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>,</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"A. Hitchcock\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tuple dapat memuat banyak nilai. Tambahkan <code>\"A. Hitchcock\"</code> sebagai nilai ketiga agar kode menampilkan <code>('Vertigo', 1958, 'A. Hitchcock')</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"vertigo_data = (\" /><text value=\"&quot;Vertigo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1958\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;A. Hitchcock&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(vertigo_data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"A. Hitchcock\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Vertigo&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"('Vertigo', 1958, 'A. Hitchcock')\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>,</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"A. Hitchcock\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Save in a variable",
            "id": 88358,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita dapat menyimpan tuple dalam variabel seperti <code>user_data</code>, sama seperti nilai lainnya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user_data = (\" /><text value=\"&quot;joe_17&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe Reed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(user_data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"('joe_17', 'Joe Reed')\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>user_data</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita menyimpan tuple dalam variabel seperti nilai lainnya. Simpan tuple dalam <code>user_data</code> agar kode menampilkan <code>('joe_17', 'Joe Reed')</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user_data = (\" /><text value=\"&quot;joe_17&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe Reed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(user_data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"('joe_17', 'Joe Reed')\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>user_data</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
